{ Bullet Manninja review. The rook brings back the opposing queen. Dilorias gives herself for the f3 knight. On move sixteen the c8 rook captures White’s queen with check. The recovery is real; the final win still belongs to White. }
1. Nf3 e5 2. Nxe5 d6 3. Nf3 Qf6 4. d4 Qxf3
{ Queen Dilorias: I take the knight on f3. A pawn can take me, and the recorded reply is exf3. This is the evening’s queen-sac theme in miniature. }
5. exf3
{ Tara: The queen is gone, and White’s e-pawn is now on f3. When reviewing a sacrifice, keep following the other pieces instead of ending the story here. }
